      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301703",
      "subQuestName": "Discuss the situation with Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170301": {
            "id": "30170301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That was pretty rough... Is that what elite mercenaries are like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170302"
            ]
          },
          "30170302": {
            "id": "30170302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It probably won't be long before we see more of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170303"
            ]
          },
          "30170303": {
            "id": "30170303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, looks like we'll have to keep our guards up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170304"
            ]
          },
          "30170304": {
            "id": "30170304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But this Doctor guy seems like a pretty tough opponent... He knew exactly where to set up an ambush. Did he predict that we would try to find Tighnari?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170305"
            ]
          },
          "30170305": {
            "id": "30170305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, going up against smart people is tough... Anyway, let's keep going."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301704",
      "subQuestName": "Find Tighnari",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170401": {
            "id": "30170401",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Oh, it's the Traveler and Paimon! What are you two doing back here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170402"
            ]
          },
          "30170402": {
            "id": "30170402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Collei, it's nice to see you again! Are you doing alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170403"
            ]
          },
          "30170403": {
            "id": "30170403",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "I... To be honest, I'm not doing too well. My Eleazar has been progressing at a faster rate lately. I'm finding it harder to complete more intricate tasks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170404"
            ]
          },
          "30170404": {
            "id": "30170404",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "As a result, Master Tighnari has taken me off the patrol schedule. He will only allow me to stay here and coordinate other people's tasks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170405"
            ]
          },
          "30170405": {
            "id": "30170405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Collei...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170406"
            ]
          },
          "30170406": {
            "id": "30170406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It seems that curing Irminsul is our only chance...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170407"
            ]
          },
          "30170407": {
            "id": "30170407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of Tighnari, did he go off on patrol? We're here to talk to him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170408"
            ]
          },
          "30170408": {
            "id": "30170408",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Oh, Master Tighnari? He just left the Avidya Forest a little while ago. He was headed to Pardis Dhyai.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170409"
            ]
          },
          "30170409": {
            "id": "30170409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, he left? But... isn't Tighnari always saying that he never wants to leave the Avidya Forest? He even turned down the sages' invitation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170410"
            ]
          },
          "30170410": {
            "id": "30170410",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "I thought it was weird, too... Master Tighnari always prioritizes his work as a Forest Watcher above everything. He almost never leaves his post. He left in a hurry this time, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170411"
            ]
          },
          "30170411": {
            "id": "30170411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He didn't give a reason?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170412"
            ]
          },
          "30170412": {
            "id": "30170412",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "No, I only found out that he left through a message he left behind. He also made sure to delegate all his tasks using a schedule.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170413"
            ]
          },
          "30170413": {
            "id": "30170413",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "To leave in such a hurry... I'd guess he had something urgent to take care of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170414"
            ]
          },
          "30170414": {
            "id": "30170414",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mentioned that he was going to Pardis Dhyai... What kind of place is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170415"
            ]
          },
          "30170415": {
            "id": "30170415",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Hm... Master Tighnari originally studied in the Amurta Darshan of the Akademiya, and Pardis Dhyai is something like the Amurta's research base. Many rare shrubs and grasses have been planted there for research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170416"
            ]
          },
          "30170416": {
            "id": "30170416",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "I know that before he became a Forest Watcher, Master Tighnari once spent a long time conducting research at Pardis Dhyai.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170417"
            ]
          },
          "30170417": {
            "id": "30170417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A research base, huh... Gotta wonder what kind of research Tighnari just decided to work on all of a sudden...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170418"
            ]
          },
          "30170418": {
            "id": "30170418",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, we don't have a lot of time, so let's go look for him at Pardis Dhyai.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170421"
            ]
          },
          "30170421": {
            "id": "30170421",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Ah... Don't worry, I'm fine. I'm used to living with Eleazar by now! If you run into Master Tighnari, please send him my regards.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170422"
            ]
          },
          "30170422": {
            "id": "30170422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Got it, will do! See you later, Collei!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301705",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Pardis Dhyai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170501": {
            "id": "30170501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, look who it is...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170504"
            ]
          },
          "30170504": {
            "id": "30170504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Thank goodness, you're okay! We were so worried about you..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301706",
      "subQuestName": "Enter Pardis Dhyai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170601": {
            "id": "30170601",
            "speakerId": 12554,
            "speakerName": "Haypasia",
            "text": "Traveler? It is you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170602"
            ]
          },
          "30170602": {
            "id": "30170602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah! It's Haypasia!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170605"
            ]
          },
          "30170605": {
            "id": "30170605",
            "speakerId": 12554,
            "speakerName": "Haypasia",
            "text": "Ahh, what a pleasant surprise! It's so nice to see the two of you again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170606"
            ]
          },
          "30170606": {
            "id": "30170606",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Who's this...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170607"
            ]
          },
          "30170607": {
            "id": "30170607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She's a scholar we met in the Avidya Forest! When we last saw each other, she was still training in the uh, what's it called... \"Satyavada Life\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170608"
            ]
          },
          "30170608": {
            "id": "30170608",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Oh... I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170609"
            ]
          },
          "30170609": {
            "id": "30170609",
            "speakerId": 12554,
            "speakerName": "Haypasia",
            "text": "That's right, we're old friends! You've come at just the right time. Ever since I've come here, hardly anyone has even talked to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170610"
            ]
          },
          "30170610": {
            "id": "30170610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Haypasia, you're way too excited about this! Actually, for you to leave the Avidya Forest means... you're not in training anymore?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170611"
            ]
          },
          "30170611": {
            "id": "30170611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, no... Did you already finish your training and reach Paripurna Life?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170612"
            ]
          },
          "30170612": {
            "id": "30170612",
            "speakerId": 12554,
            "speakerName": "Haypasia",
            "text": "Hehehe... What do you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170613"
            ]
          },
          "30170613": {
            "id": "30170613",
            "speakerId": 12554,
            "speakerName": "Haypasia",
            "text": "My consciousness... has already managed to make contact with the divine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170614"
            ]
          },
          "30170614": {
            "id": "30170614",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "...Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170615"
            ]
          },
          "30170615": {
            "id": "30170615",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You did it!? Congratulations!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301707",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Tighnari",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170701": {
            "id": "30170701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Okay, we've finally lost them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170704"
            ]
          },
          "30170704": {
            "id": "30170704",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Are you okay, Nahida? ...Wait, no! Something feels different... {NICKNAME}, you're back!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30170705"
            ]
          },
          "30170705": {
            "id": "30170705",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "#Oh? {NICKNAME}'s back?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301708",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30170801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30170801": {
            "id": "30170801",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "I had already made up my mind to be honest with you, so I didn't try to hide my current condition... Don't worry about me, I'll be fine."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}